Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(visual-analysis): wire server batch recovery

- connected local server-job backup helper to the Visual Analysis server batch UI
- normalized server job counters for backup metadata
- added automatic metadata and Analysis Bundle backup on refresh/terminal states
- added persistent server job recovery and browser backup UI
- added safe localStorage fallback, eviction, malformed-data handling, and secret stripping
- added unit tests for backup helper behavior
- preserved existing partial/canceled bundle workflows

